EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT id FROM inc_t WHERE category = 1 OR price < 10 ORDER BY embedding <-> '[0,0,0]' LIMIT 5;
                        QUERY PLAN                         
-----------------------------------------------------------
 Limit
   ->  Custom Scan (IvfIncludeScan) on inc_t
         Include Filter: ((category = 1) OR (price < 10))
