-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Limit
   ->  Custom Scan (IvfIncludeScan) on inc_t
         Include Filter: ((price > 95) OR ((category = 1) AND (price < 50)))
         ->  Index Scan using inc_t_ivf on inc_t
               Order By: (embedding <-> '[0,0,0]'::vector)
               Filter: (((category = 1) AND (price < 50)) OR (price > 95))
(6 rows)

